<h3>So, Can Different Rooms Have Different Styles?</h3>
<p class="isSelectedEnd"><strong>Yes, and they often should.</strong></p>
<p class="isSelectedEnd">Your home doesn't need to look like one large showroom. It should reflect the different ways you use each room and allow your personality to come through.</p>
